;Inlet5 including New Extensions

*begin Inlet5

*export Inlet5-1.001 
*export Inlet5-1.019
*export Inlet5-2.033 
*export Inlet5-2.052
*export Inlet5-3.052 
*export Inlet5-3.061
*export NewExtension.001 
*export NewExtension.015b

*Include Inlet5-1
*Include Inlet5-2
*Include Inlet5-3
*Include NewExtension

*equate Inlet5-1.019 Inlet5-2.033
*equate Inlet5-2.052 Inlet5-3.052
*equate Inlet5-3.061 NewExtension.015b

*end Inlet5